{"uid":"242f57f50a69223d","name":"test_a_fresh_episodes_move_to_running_clears_the_stale_pause_reason","fullName":"tests.test_last_approach#test_a_fresh_episodes_move_to_running_clears_the_stale_pause_reason","historyId":"6234f5df4fb3866c286475317708a2b9","time":{"start":1791891295587,"stop":1791891295954,"duration":367},"description":"The startup write that moves a resumed episode to `running`\n    (`_run_job_core`'s first `update_status`) also nulls `pauseReason`: the\n    engine-recorded pause belongs to the process that held it, and leaving its\n    reason beside `state: \"running\"` would strand a ruling-wanted marker on a\n    run that is working again. Read off the engine's own call site rather than\n    retyped, so it cannot drift.","descriptionHtml":"<p>The startup write that moves a resumed episode to <code>running</code><br />\n(<code>_run_job_core</code>'s first <code>update_status</code>) also nulls <code>pauseReason</code>: the<br />\nengine-recorded pause belongs to the process that held it, and leaving its<br />\nreason beside <code>state: &quot;running&quot;</code> would strand a ruling-wanted marker on a<br />\nrun that is working again. Read off the engine's own call site rather than<br />\nretyped, so it cannot drift.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791891119438,"stop":1791891119438,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791891119438,"stop":1791891119438,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791891295577,"stop":1791